&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Why At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Dotmatics, a Siemens company,&amp;nbsp; we believe science, data, and decision-making must be deeply intertwined for innovation to thrive. Our Portfolio includes Luma, LumaLab Connect, ELN Platform, Graphpad Prism, Geneious, SnapGene, Protein Metrics, OMIQ, FCS Express, LabArchives, NQuery, EasyPanel, SoftGenetics and Virscidian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a vision for a new Lab of the Future that will change the future of scientific research.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created the world’s most comprehensive digital science platform – best-of-breed software applications already used by more than 2 million scientists, together in a single ecosystem united by a powerful, flexible enterprise data platform. This is not flat data buried away in digital graveyards. This is dynamic, multi-dimensional decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scientific enterprises need a new level of effectiveness to achieve tomorrow’s breakthroughs. Illness will not wait. The biosphere will not wait. We are tireless in our vision, because the time for innovation is now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the Future of Science At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global team of more than 800 colleagues are dedicated to supporting our customers in over 180 countries. Together, with our scientific community of users, we accelerate scientific innovation in order to make the world a healthier, cleaner, and safer place to live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a collaborative, global team pushing the boundaries of scientific innovation.&amp;nbsp; Your ideas and efforts will have a tangible impact, accelerating scientific progress and discovery. We offer a dynamic, remote-friendly environment that fosters high integrity and collaboration, empowering you to excel. Dotmatics is a company built by scientists, for scientists. Combined, we are now the world’s largest cloud-based scientific research R&amp;amp;D platform. We need your help to keep growing and pioneering the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Science Driven. We are Customer Centric. We are Better Together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced market leader, thought leader and SME in Lab Automation and Orchestration.&lt;br&gt;Lab automation is where science meets engineering. Robotics, liquid handlers, instruments, and scheduling software are moving labs from manual work toward automated, data driven, and eventually autonomous operation. While we are supporting fully automated labs, most labs still run as islands. Instruments speak different languages, workflows are hard to change, and the data that comes off the line rarely arrives ready for analysis or AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building Luma, a Scientific Intelligence Platform for life sciences and materials science. Lab Orchestration and automation are core to our Molecule to Market story, and they connect directly to the strengths of Siemens in industrial automation. We need someone to own the market strategy for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a customer and market facing role. You’ll spend real time with lab automation leaders at pharma, biotech, CDMOs, and research institutes across the UK and Europe, hearing what they need and bringing it back to the business. You’ll also support teams around the world across Siemens, including sales, product, services, customer success, and the Siemens Solution Marketing team, so everyone can speak to the lab automation market with confidence and one consistent story. You’ll work with industry thought leaders to shape the conversation on autonomous labs and AI. Your job is to drive software adoption and AI use cases in lab automation. You will shape where we play, who we sell to, how we position, and how we win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll spend your time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer engagements: meeting automation leaders, scientists, and engineers, joining pursuits, and bringing what you hear back to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market analysis: sizing segments, tracking competitors and automation vendors, and spotting trends early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales enablement: giving teams across regions the talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and proof points to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution marketing: partnering with the Siemens Solution Marketing team on content, campaigns, events, and messaging for the lab automation audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought leadership: working with industry thought leaders, inside and outside Siemens, to shape the conversation on self driving labs and the future of the automated lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption and AI use cases: identifying, proving, and spreading the use cases that get labs running on Luma and putting AI to work on automated workflows and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and ecosystem engagement: working with instrument makers, robotics providers, and integrators so our joint story is clear to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross organization alignment: working across Siemens DISW and DI Automation teams so we show up as one company with one story for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple. Drive excellence in how we represent ourselves to lab automation buyers, and turn that into real software adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the market strategy for Luma in lab automation, including workflow orchestration, scheduling, instrument integration, data capture, and autonomous lab concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define target segments, buyer personas, and priority accounts, including Heads of Lab Automation, Automation Engineers, Discovery Technologies, Research IT, Core Facilities, and Operations leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build positioning and messaging that speaks to automation engineers, scientists, IT leaders, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive software adoption by working with customers and field teams to find the workflows where Luma delivers value fastest, and by capturing what works so others can repeat it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prove AI use cases for lab automation, including closed loop experimentation, smarter scheduling, and data prepared for tools like NVIDIA BioNeMo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate automation pain points into clear value, including less integration work, faster workflow changes, better use of instruments, trusted data, and a clear path from automation islands to connected labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Siemens Solution Marketing team to build content, campaigns, and events for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with industry thought leaders, analysts, and partners to build credibility and bring outside voices into our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the competitive view against other informatics vendors, scheduling and orchestration tools, automation vendors, and in house builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the business case, pricing inputs, and value story with Finance and Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip global teams with talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and customer proof points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with DISW and DI Automation teams to align messaging, joint offers, and customer conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product on roadmap priorities based on what automation teams tell us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect lab automation to the bigger Molecule to Market narrative, including ELN, Biologics, and Tech Transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic pursuits and executive conversations with customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track market trends, including autonomous labs, AI driven discovery, robotics, and data standards, and turn them into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for people who have &lt;/strong&gt;10 or more years in life sciences, lab automation, or scientific technology, with hands on experience in a pharma, biotech, CDMO, research institute, or automation vendor setting.&amp;nbsp; You will bring Strong analytical skills, including sizing markets and building a business case excellent writing and presentation skills. Ideally holding a degree in life sciences, engineering, robotics, or a related field, with a Masters or PhD a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The key skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how automated labs work day to day, including liquid handling, robotics, instrument integration, workflow scheduling, and the data that flows from them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of how automation leaders make decisions, balance speed, cost, and flexibility, and work with scientists, IT, and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in product marketing, market strategy, product management, or commercial roles at a software, automation, informatics, or life sciences solutions company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scheduling and orchestration software, LIMS, ELN, or lab data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving software adoption, or of turning new technology such as AI into use cases customers actually adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to turn complex science and technology into clear, simple messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with senior leaders, industry experts, and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across a large, global, matrixed organisation and build trust with teams in different regions and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a lab automation team or an automated lab build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industrial automation concepts and how they apply to the lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lab data standards and open interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI, machine learning, or data platforms in a scientific setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with industry thought leaders, analysts, automation vendors, or research institutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across the UK and European life sciences community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear lab automation market strategy adopted by Sales, Product, Services, and Solution Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging and sales tools that teams around the world actually use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One consistent story for lab automation across Dotmatics, DISW, and DI Automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing software adoption and a library of proven AI use cases in lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry voices who help tell our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing pipeline and wins tied to lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation leaders who can say, in their own words, why Luma helps them connect their labs and move toward autonomous operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
