&lt;li&gt;Define evaluation criteria and build test harnesses for AI systems where correctness is ambiguous and domain-specific&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients to understand their workflows, validate AI behavior, and iterate toward production quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with core engineering teams to generalize client-specific work into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shared AI infrastructure (agent frameworks, tool integrations, deployment pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain production AI systems with attention to reliability, cost, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
