&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;Design Director&amp;nbsp;to lead the Soho Home Design team and drive the creative direction, quality, and delivery of our product collections across Furniture, Upholstery, Lighting, Mirrors, Décor and Textiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Chief Creative Officer, this role will translate the overarching creative vision for Soho Home into a clear, ownable and commercially relevant product direction - ensuring every collection feels distinctive &amp;amp; cohesive to Soho Home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design Director will provide strong creative leadership to the Design team, while bringing pace and consistency to the journey from concept through to sketching, development and finalisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly collaborative role, working closely with Product Operations, NPD, QC, to ensure the creative ambition is delivered through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Chief Creative Officer to define and evolve the creative direction for Soho Home across each season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the wider Soho Home creative vision into clear product and category direction for the Design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong and consistent creative point of view across all categories and seasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure collections feel considered as a whole, with a clear balance of statement pieces, core products and commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the team to develop products with a strong design narrative, whilst maintaining the quality, craftsmanship and functionality expected of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for new design directions, materials, techniques, collaborations and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Soho Home continues to feel culturally relevant and creatively progressive without losing its established design language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Line Planning &amp;amp; Seasonal Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear category direction, product briefs and creative priorities before design work begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Design team is working against an agreed line plan, with clarity on what needs to be designed, why and by when.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance creative ambition with commercial, production and capacity considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review collections holistically throughout the season to identify gaps, duplication or opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead seasonal sketch reviews and ensure designs are developed against the agreed creative and line-plan direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team maintains momentum from initial concept through to finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Design Team Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and develop the Soho Home Design team, creating a high-performing and collaborative creative culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations around quality, output, deadlines and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate design work effectively across the team, taking into account, category expertise and capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor Designers supporting their development and creative growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular feedback and challenge to ensure the team is consistently producing work at the required level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify skills gaps and support the development of the team&#39;s capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across Design, NPD, QC and Product Operations to ensure the wider product team operates as one function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative leadership throughout the design and development process, from initial concept through to final approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with NPD and Product Operations to ensure creative decisions are translated accurately into development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve key design developments, finishes, materials and details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the integrity of the original design intent is maintained throughout development and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with suppliers and manufacturers where required to push quality, craftsmanship and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the resolution of design challenges during development without compromising the overall creative vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure products are designed with a clear understanding of manufacturing, quality, cost and lead-time implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Operations to maintain a clear and realistic design critical path across all seasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with NPD to ensure designs are commercially viable and ready for briefing and development at the required milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sourcing and suppliers to identify new capabilities, materials and manufacturing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Quality to ensure design intent and product standards are maintained through development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Process &amp;amp; Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a clear and disciplined Design process across concept, sketching, review, development and finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure key creative decisions are made at the right stage and communicated clearly to the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Operations to maintain visibility of design progress, risks, dependencies and key deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential delivery risks early and work proactively with the relevant teams to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage a culture of accountability, clarity and decisive creative leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually review and improve the Design team&#39;s ways of working to enable the team to spend more time designing and less time navigating process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a senior design leadership role within interiors, furniture, homeware, hospitality or a related creative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly developed and recognisable design point of view, with the ability to create products that feel distinctive and ownable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading and developing a creative design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of furniture, upholstery, lighting, décor and/or interiors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of materials, finishes, manufacturing processes and product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing collections from initial concept through to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how to balance creative ambition with commercial and operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and communication skills, with the ability to articulate a creative vision clearly to both creative and commercial stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, decisive and comfortable managing multiple categories, projects and deadlines simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and confident working with senior leadership, suppliers and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of luxury, hospitality and/or premium interiors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity for culture, art, fashion, architecture, travel, craftsmanship and emerging design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
